{
  "$schema": "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  "extends": [
    "config:recommended"
  ],
  "enabledManagers": [
    "argocd",
    "custom.regex",
    "docker-compose",
    "github-actions",
    "gomod",
    "kustomize",
    "kubernetes"
  ],
  "ignorePaths": [
    "**/node_modules/**",
    "**/bower_components/**",
    "e2e/testdata/**"
  ],
  "automerge": false,
  "prConcurrentLimit": 0,
  "prHourlyLimit": 0,
  "ignoreUnstable": true,
  "separateMajorMinor": false,
  "separateMinorPatch": false,
  "separateMultipleMajor": false,
  "packageRules": [
    {
      "description": "Forgejo requires sequential major upgrades to execute database schema migrations",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "code.forgejo.org/forgejo-helm/forgejo",
        "forgejo"
      ],
      "separateMajorMinor": true,
      "separateMultipleMajor": true,
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "⚠️ **Forgejo Upgrade Requirement**: Upstream requires upgrading major releases sequentially (e.g. 7.x → 8.x → 9.x) to execute database migrations in sequence. Do not skip major versions."
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "Immich requires review of breaking changes and migration checkpoints",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "ghcr.io/immich-app/immich-charts/immich",
        "immich"
      ],
      "separateMajorMinor": true,
      "separateMultipleMajor": true,
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "⚠️ **Immich Upgrade Requirement**: Review the [Immich Release Notes](https://github.com/immich-app/immich/releases) for breaking changes and verify all migration jobs are completed before proceeding to subsequent releases."
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "Longhorn requires sequential minor version upgrades",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "longhorn"
      ],
      "separateMajorMinor": true,
      "separateMinorPatch": true,
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "⚠️ **Longhorn Upgrade Requirement**: Upstream requires sequential minor version upgrades (e.g. 1.10 → 1.11 → 1.12). Skipping minor versions is unsupported. Note: volume engine upgrades are automated via `concurrentAutomaticEngineUpgradePerNodeLimit`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "cert-manager recommends sequential minor version upgrades for CRD/webhook alignment",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "cert-manager"
      ],
      "separateMajorMinor": true,
      "separateMinorPatch": true,
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "⚠️ **cert-manager Upgrade Requirement**: Upstream recommends upgrading minor versions sequentially (e.g. 1.15 → 1.16 → 1.17) to ensure CRD schema and webhook compatibility."
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "CloudNativePG operand major upgrades trigger automated in-place pg_upgrade",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "ghcr.io/cloudnative-pg/postgresql",
        "ghcr.io/tensorchord/cloudnative-vectorchord"
      ],
      "matchDepNames": [
        "!cloudnative-pg-debian-release"
      ],
      "separateMajorMinor": true,
      "separateMultipleMajor": true,
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "ℹ️ **CloudNativePG Upgrade**: Minor versions roll the instance pod. A major PostgreSQL version triggers CloudNativePG's offline in-place `pg_upgrade` Job on sync, with the whole cluster down until it finishes. Before merging a major: take an on-demand CNPG `volumeSnapshot` `Backup` and confirm the extensions and the target image's Debian release match the current one. If the upgrade Job fails, revert this PR. After it succeeds, refresh statistics and take a new backup. See [docs/upgrades.md](docs/upgrades.md#1-automated-major-database-upgrades-cloudnativepg)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "cloudnative-vectorchord tags are <pg major>.<pg minor>-<VectorChord semver>; docker versioning would treat the VectorChord version as a fixed compatibility suffix and never propose an update",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "ghcr.io/tensorchord/cloudnative-vectorchord"
      ],
      "versioning": "regex:^(?<major>\\d+)\\.(?<minor>\\d+)-(?<patch>\\d+)\\.(?<build>\\d+)\\.(?<revision>\\d+)$",
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "⚠️ **cloudnative-vectorchord**: Renovate labels VectorChord version changes as patch updates; check the Immich release notes for the supported VectorChord range. The tags do not name the Debian release. On a PostgreSQL major upgrade, compare the `org.opencontainers.image.base.name` label of the new image with the current one: `pg_upgrade` does not support a Debian release change. On a minor update, a Debian release change is safe (see [docs/upgrades.md](docs/upgrades.md#debian-release-moves))."
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "Debian release moves of CloudNativePG operand images keep the PostgreSQL version and never run pg_upgrade",
      "matchDepNames": [
        "cloudnative-pg-debian-release"
      ],
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "ℹ️ **CloudNativePG Debian Release Move**: Only the image's Debian release changes; the PostgreSQL version stays the same, so the operator rolls each instance pod and no `pg_upgrade` runs. Every cluster uses CNPG's default `C` collation, which does not depend on glibc, so no reindex is needed. See [docs/upgrades.md](docs/upgrades.md#debian-release-moves)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "MariaDB operand upgrades: separate PRs per major, release-notes reminder",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "docker.io/library/mariadb"
      ],
      "separateMajorMinor": true,
      "separateMultipleMajor": true,
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "ℹ️ **MariaDB Upgrade**: Merging is the whole procedure (docs/upgrades.md §8): the Supernote sync first takes a pre-upgrade volume snapshot (PreSync `PhysicalBackup` hook, which fails the sync if the snapshot fails), the instance shuts down cleanly, and the entrypoint runs `mariadb-upgrade` (`mariadbAutoUpgradeEnabled`). Review the [MariaDB release notes](https://mariadb.com/docs/release-notes) for removed or changed options first; MariaDB cannot be downgraded in place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "Re-vendor the patched DocumentDB operator chart on version bumps so the PR contains the complete tree",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "ghcr.io/documentdb/documentdb-operator"
      ],
      "postUpgradeTasks": {
        "commands": [
          "bash scripts/vendor-documentdb-operator.sh"
        ],
        "fileFilters": [
          "apps/documentdb-operator/helm/local-charts/**"
        ],
        "executionMode": "update",
        "installTools": {
          "helm": {}
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Refresh the hass-oidc-auth zip sha256 on version bumps so the PR never ships a stale hash",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "christiaangoossens/hass-oidc-auth"
      ],
      "postUpgradeTasks": {
        "commands": [
          "bash scripts/refresh-hass-oidc-auth-sha.sh"
        ],
        "fileFilters": [
          "apps/homeassistant/1_homeassistant_deployment.yaml"
        ],
        "executionMode": "update"
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Group every Kubernetes version pin (k3s, PSA labels, kind node image, documentation, e2e hook comments) into one PR",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "kindest/node",
        "k3s-io/k3s"
      ],
      "groupName": "kubernetes-version",
      "separateMultipleMinor": true,
      "prBodyNotes": [
        "⚠️ **Cluster Upgrade Ordering**: the PSA labels must never reference a Kubernetes minor newer than the API server. Merge a minor bump only once this PR also carries the matching k3s minor (`host/versions.env` and the system-upgrade-controller Plans, which upgrade the nodes in the next 01:00–02:00 Europe/Lisbon window); k3s ships a new minor after upstream Kubernetes does. The e2e suite also requires a local kind CLI new enough to pull the new `kindest/node` image (see docs/upgrades.md)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "Group Cilium Helm chart and CRD tag bumps into one PR so the release and its CRDs stay version-aligned",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "cilium",
        "https://github.com/cilium/cilium.git"
      ],
      "groupName": "cilium"
    },
    {
      "description": "Group the Prometheus Operator CRD tag bumps (repo pin + e2e hook) so the release and its CRDs stay version-aligned",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator",
        "https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator.git"
      ],
      "groupName": "prometheus-operator-crds"
    },
    {
      "description": "Group the external-snapshotter CRD tag and the snapshot-controller image so the release and its controller stay version-aligned",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "https://github.com/kubernetes-csi/external-snapshotter.git",
        "registry.k8s.io/sig-storage/snapshot-controller"
      ],
      "groupName": "snapshot-controller"
    },
    {
      "description": "Group the CrowdSec Envoy bouncer chart, image, and the e2e load-hook image so one bump arrives in a single PR",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "ghcr.io/kdwils/charts/envoy-proxy-bouncer",
        "ghcr.io/kdwils/envoy-proxy-bouncer"
      ],
      "groupName": "crowdsec-envoy-bouncer"
    },
    {
      "description": "Group the Envoy Gateway chart and image bumps into one PR",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "docker.io/envoyproxy/gateway-helm",
        "gateway-helm"
      ],
      "groupName": "envoy-gateway"
    },
    {
      "description": "Group every OpenCloud image bump (server, yjs, web extensions) into one PR",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "docker.io/opencloudeu/opencloud-rolling",
        "docker.io/opencloudeu/yjs",
        "/^docker\\.io\\/opencloudeu\\/web-extensions-/"
      ],
      "groupName": "opencloud"
    },
    {
      "description": "The variant-aware regex manager owns the web-extension tags; the kubernetes manager cannot parse variant-prefixed tags",
      "matchManagers": [
        "kubernetes"
      ],
      "matchDepNames": [
        "docker.io/opencloudeu/web-extensions"
      ],
      "enabled": false
    },
    {
      "description": "Group the system-upgrade-controller CRD tag, remote base, and image so the release and its CRDs stay version-aligned",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "https://github.com/rancher/system-upgrade-controller.git",
        "rancher/system-upgrade-controller",
        "docker.io/rancher/system-upgrade-controller"
      ],
      "groupName": "system-upgrade-controller"
    },
    {
      "description": "Group the VictoriaMetrics single-node and vmalert charts so the query and rule-evaluation sides move together",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "victoria-metrics-single",
        "victoria-metrics-alert"
      ],
      "groupName": "victoria-metrics"
    },
    {
      "description": "Group the agents VM tool pins: one PR rebuilds the VM root once in the nightly window",
      "matchFileNames": [
        "host/agents-vm/versions.env"
      ],
      "groupName": "agents-vm-tools"
    }
  ],
  "argocd": {
    "managerFilePatterns": [
      "/^apps/.+\\.ya?ml$/"
    ]
  },
  "kubernetes": {
    "managerFilePatterns": [
      "/^apps/.+\\.ya?ml$/"
    ]
  },
  "kustomize": {
    "managerFilePatterns": [
      "/^apps/.+/helm(?:/.+)?/kustomization\\.yaml$/"
    ]
  },
  "customDatasources": {
    "antigravity-cli": {
      "defaultRegistryUrlTemplate": "https://antigravity-cli-auto-updater-974169037036.us-central1.run.app/manifests/linux_amd64.json",
      "format": "json",
      "transformTemplates": [
        "{\"releases\": [{\"version\": version}]}"
      ]
    }
  },
  "customManagers": [
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the Authelia Helm chart",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/authelia/helm/kustomization\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?ms)^\\s+- name:\\s+authelia\\s+repo:\\s+https://charts\\.authelia\\.com\\s+version:\\s*(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)"
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "authelia",
      "datasourceTemplate": "helm",
      "versioningTemplate": "helm",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://charts.authelia.com"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the Grafana plugin-loader init image",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/grafana/0_grafana\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^\\s*image:\\s*(?<depName>docker\\.io/library/alpine):(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)\\s*$"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://index.docker.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the Kubernetes minor version in Pod Security Admission labels",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/.*\\.ya?ml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^\\s*pod-security\\.kubernetes\\.io/(?:enforce|audit|warn)-version:\\s*v(?<currentValue>\\d+\\.\\d+)\\s*$"
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "kindest/node",
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "loose",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://index.docker.io",
      "extractVersionTemplate": "^v?(?<version>\\d+\\.\\d+)"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the e2e kind node image version",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^e2e/examples/homeworld\\.suite\\.ya?ml$/",
        "/^e2e/README\\.md$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^\\s*kubeVersion:\\s*(?<currentValue>v\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+)\\s*$",
        "Kubernetes `(?<currentValue>v\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+)`"
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "kindest/node",
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://index.docker.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the Kubernetes minor version in user namespaces documentation",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^README\\.md$/",
        "/^AGENTS\\.md$/",
        "/^docs/pod-security\\.md$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "Kubernetes (?<currentValue>\\d+\\.\\d+) User Namespaces",
        "Kubernetes (?<currentValue>\\d+\\.\\d+) user namespaces"
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "kindest/node",
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "loose",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://index.docker.io",
      "extractVersionTemplate": "^v?(?<version>\\d+\\.\\d+)"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the Kubernetes minor version in e2e staging hook comments",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^e2e/examples/hooks/rewrite-staging\\.py$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "[Kk]8s (?<currentValue>\\d+\\.\\d+)",
        "fail Kubernetes (?<currentValue>\\d+\\.\\d+)\\."
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "kindest/node",
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "loose",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://index.docker.io",
      "extractVersionTemplate": "^v?(?<version>\\d+\\.\\d+)"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update CloudNativePG Cluster images",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/(?:authelia|crowdsec|forgejo|homeassistant|immich|vaultwarden|woodpecker)/0_postgres\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^\\s*imageName:\\s*(?<depName>ghcr\\.io/[^:\\s]+):(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)\\s*$"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://ghcr.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Move CloudNativePG Cluster images to the newest Debian stable release CNPG publishes for the pinned PostgreSQL version (the docker manager above treats the -system-<debian> suffix as fixed)",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/(?:authelia|crowdsec|forgejo|homeassistant|immich|vaultwarden|woodpecker)/0_postgres\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^\\s*imageName:\\s*(?<packageName>ghcr\\.io/cloudnative-pg/postgresql):(?<pgVersion>\\d+\\.\\d+)-system-(?<currentValue>[a-z]+)\\s*$"
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "cloudnative-pg-debian-release",
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "debian",
      "extractVersionTemplate": "^{{{pgVersion}}}-system-(?<version>[a-z]+)$",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://ghcr.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the operator-managed OpenTelemetry Collector image",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/otel-collector/1_collector\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^\\s+image:\\s*(?<depName>ghcr\\.io/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-releases/opentelemetry-collector-contrib):(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)\\s*$"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://ghcr.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the DocumentDB Operator vendored chart version",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/documentdb-operator/helm/local-charts/documentdb-operator/Chart\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^version:\\s*(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)\\s*$"
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "ghcr.io/documentdb/documentdb-operator",
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "semver"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the DocumentDB engine/gateway version for the operator",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/documentdb-operator/helm/values\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^documentDbVersion:\\s*\"(?<currentValue>[^\"]+)\""
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "ghcr.io/documentdb/documentdb/documentdb-local",
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://ghcr.io",
      "versioningTemplate": "regex:^(?:pg\\d+-)?(?<major>\\d+)\\.(?<minor>\\d+)\\.(?<patch>\\d+)$"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the DocumentDB engine version for DocumentDB clusters",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/notesnook/0_documentdb\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^\\s*documentDBVersion:\\s*\"(?<currentValue>[^\"]+)\""
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "ghcr.io/documentdb/documentdb/documentdb-local",
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://ghcr.io",
      "versioningTemplate": "regex:^(?:pg\\d+-)?(?<major>\\d+)\\.(?<minor>\\d+)\\.(?<patch>\\d+)$"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update DocumentDB Cluster postgres images",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/notesnook/0_documentdb\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^\\s*postgres:\\s*(?<depName>ghcr\\.io/[^:\\s]+):(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)\\s*$"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://ghcr.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the Cilium Helm chart",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps\\/cilium\\/helm\\/kustomization\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?ms)^\\s+- name:\\s+cilium\\s+repo:\\s+https://helm\\.cilium\\.io\\s+version:\\s*(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)"
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "cilium",
      "datasourceTemplate": "helm",
      "versioningTemplate": "helm",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://helm.cilium.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the CrowdSec Helm chart",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/crowdsec/helm/kustomization\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?ms)^\\s+- name:\\s+crowdsec\\s+repo:\\s+https://crowdsecurity\\.github\\.io/helm-charts\\s+version:\\s*(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)"
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "crowdsec",
      "datasourceTemplate": "helm",
      "versioningTemplate": "helm",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://crowdsecurity.github.io/helm-charts"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the CrowdSec image",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/crowdsec/helm/values\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?ms)^image:\\s*\\n\\s+repository:\\s*docker\\.io/(?<depName>crowdsecurity/crowdsec)\\s*\\n\\s+tag:\\s*(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://index.docker.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the CrowdSec wait-for-LAPI helper images",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/crowdsec/helm/values\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?ms)^\\s+wait_for_lapi:\\s*\\n(?:\\s*#[^\\n]*\\n)*\\s+image:\\s*\\n\\s+repository:\\s*docker\\.io/(?<depName>library/busybox)\\s*\\n\\s+tag:\\s*[\"']?(?<currentValue>[^\"'\\s#]+)"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://index.docker.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the CrowdSec kubectl helper image",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/crowdsec/helm/values\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?ms)^\\s+kubectl:\\s*\\n\\s+repository:\\s*docker\\.io/(?<depName>alpine/kubectl)\\s*\\n\\s+tag:\\s*[\"']?(?<currentValue>[^\"'\\s#]+)[\"']?"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://index.docker.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the Envoy bouncer image",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/crowdsec-envoy-bouncer/helm/values\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?ms)^image:\\s*\\n\\s+repository:\\s*(?<depName>ghcr\\.io/kdwils/envoy-proxy-bouncer)\\s*\\n\\s+tag:\\s*(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://ghcr.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the metrics-server Helm chart",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/metrics-server/helm/kustomization\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?ms)^\\s+- name:\\s+metrics-server\\s+repo:\\s+https://kubernetes-sigs\\.github\\.io/metrics-server\\s+version:\\s*(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)"
      ],
      "depNameTemplate": "metrics-server",
      "datasourceTemplate": "helm",
      "versioningTemplate": "helm",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://kubernetes-sigs.github.io/metrics-server"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the Dragonfly operand images (argocd, authelia, immich, supernote)",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/argocd/0_dragonfly\\.yaml$/",
        "/^apps/authelia/0_dragonfly\\.yaml$/",
        "/^apps/immich/0_dragonfly\\.yaml$/",
        "/^apps/supernote/0_dragonfly\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?m)^\\s*image:\\s*(?<depName>docker\\.dragonflydb\\.io/dragonflydb/dragonfly):(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)\\s*$"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://docker.dragonflydb.io"
    },
    {
      "customType": "regex",
      "description": "Update the Authelia image",
      "managerFilePatterns": [
        "/^apps/authelia/helm/values\\.yaml$/"
      ],
      "matchStrings": [
        "(?ms)^image:\\s*\\n\\s+registry:\\s*ghcr\\.io\\s*\\n\\s+repository:\\s*(?<depName>authelia/authelia)\\s*\\n\\s+tag:\\s*(?<currentValue>[^\\s#]+)"
      ],
      "datasourceTemplate": "docker",
      "versioningTemplate": "docker",
      "registryUrlTemplate": "https://ghcr.io"
    },
